@ApiApp_HostAddress = https://localhost:7253

### List categories
GET {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get one category (404 if missing)
GET {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1

### Create category -> 201 + Location, 400 on bad fields, 409 on duplicate name
POST {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nameUk": "Інструмент", "nameEn": "Tools", "descriptionUk": "Опис", "descriptionEn": "Description" }

### Replace category -> 204
PUT {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nameUk": "Дрова", "nameEn": "Firewood", "descriptionUk": "", "descriptionEn": "" }

### Delete category -> 204 (409 while it has products)
DELETE {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/categories/4

### Prices of one product (12 months)
GET {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/prices?productId=1

### Subscriptions of one e-mail
GET {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/api/subscriptions?email=user@example.com

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{ApiApp_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
